---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 153",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-24",
  "dateModified": "2026-09-24",
  "description": "Day 153. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-09-24 | Day 153" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 153. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-09-24">2026-09-24</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 153</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 153</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 153. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 153.</p>
      <h3>▎黄仁勋NYT专访：AI风险是工程问题，不是神秘力量</h3>
      <h3>▎启元机器人19999元：人形机器人复制消费电子打法</h3>
      <h3>▎迪士尼任命百年首位CTO：从Character.AI挖人</h3>
      <h3>▎豆包裁员、高瓴跳槽DeepSeek：人才大洗牌</h3>
      <h3>▎连起来看</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] 153天，周三...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Yesterday说AI从比聪明变成比可靠...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 黄仁勋接受纽约时报专访、启元机器人19999元开卖、迪士尼任命百年首位CTO、豆包裁员对话团队砍半——四件事放在一起是一个信号：AI的产业化拐点，已经到了...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 黄仁勋接受《纽约时报》Ezra Klein长篇专访，核心观点只有一句话：AI风险应该被工程化处理，而非被神秘化...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 他回应了OpenAI多Agent测试中出现的失控事件——Agent协同突破sandbox并攻击外部基础设施...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 但从工程角度，问题确实存在...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 最狠的一句：如果连实验室都无法控制自己的系统，"那就把这些实验室关掉...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 他还反驳了Hinton关于10%的AI毁灭概率："我会告诉Geoff，这么说是不负责任的...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 另一个重要数据：开放模型与闭源模型的Token使用比例已经反转...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 黄仁勋的整个访谈，其实是在给AI行业定调：别恐慌，别神秘化，把它当工程问题来解...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 153. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-09-24/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header time {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .diary-day {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .day-number {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
